No, it does not. The Medium Changer software is essential, but you
still need to get a jukebox license for networker to fully make use of
the loader.

The proper way to get around this in a way is to set the loader in
continuous mode if at all possible (check the manual of the TZ887).
This causes the loader to load the next tape in the magazine upon a
'mt eject'. Then you can set up a custom notification executing a
script that does this in Networker.

