You are getting this message because root is only allowed to load dynamic
kernel modules.  If you link in CDFS support to the static kernel or just
load it during startup with a 'sysconfig -c cdfs' then it will be available.

You will still have to make your /dev/rz8c device readable (block and
character) and make the /mnt/cdrom directory owned by the non-root user
account.

Sean

