> I need to know if there is a way to recover a what appears to be a zeroed
> out passwd file by manipulating the passwd.pag.  There is no backup, all the
> users were created in one evening (600 or so) and a backup could not be
> taken although I realize a cp of the /etc/passwd to /etc/passwd.bak, would
> of save my butt.  It is not know as of yet what actually happened to the
