You will probably need both the .dir and .pag files, but if you have
these you could do it like this (if the names are passwd.pag and
passwd.dir):

makedbm -u passwd > passwd.restore

This will create a listing with lines that looks like:

<number> <regular passwd entry>

so, som awk processing might be in place.

makedbm -u passwd | awk '{print $2}' > passwd.restore

